[TITLE] Support perferred field in VolumeNodeAffinity of persistentVolume [BODY] What would you like to be added?
Add Preferred field in VolumeNodeAffinity
// VolumeNodeAffinity defines constraints that limit what nodes this volume can be accessed from.
type VolumeNodeAffinity struct {
// required specifies hard node constraints that must be met.
Required *NodeSelector `json:"required,omitempty" protobuf:"bytes,1,opt,name=required"`
// Preferred define the optimal node constraints.
Preferred *NodeSelector `json:"required,omitempty" protobuf:"bytes,1,opt,name=required"`
}
Why is this needed?
related:
#131108
We（AlibabaCloud）has recently introduced
Regional EBS
. a new type of EBS that enables pod(app) to utilize it across all zones within a specific region, thereby achieving higher availablity. In this case, the EBS backend storage nodes are spread across different availability zones, and the relevant information is returned from Openapi. We expect to add this configuration to the VolumeNodeAffinity to prioritize scheduling to a particular availability zone, so as to maximize read performance.

